{"hymn":"FR138","parent":"E761","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"Prie quand ton âme veut parler","subtitle":"","syl":{"n1":"Prie","n2":"quand","n3":"ton","n4":"âme","n6":"veut","n7":["par","i"],"n8":["ler","t"],"n9":"Et","n10":"dire","n11":["a","i"],"n12":["vec","t"],"n13":["ar","i"],"n14":["deur,","t"],"n15":"Les","n16":["ré","i"],"n17":["ac","m"],"n18":["tions","t"],"n19":"et","n21":"les","n22":["pen","i"],"n23":["sé","m"],"n24":["es,","t"],"n25":"Qui","n26":["mon","i"],"n27":["tent","t"],"n28":"de","n30":"ton","n31":"cœur."},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Prie quand ton âme veut pleurer","Sous le poids des soupirs.","Dieu seul toujours sait t'écouter,","Comprendre ton désir."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Prie comme l'âme d'un enfant,","Apprends ses simples mots.","Ensuite attends, calme et confiant,","Tous les secours d'en haut."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Le souffle vital du chrétien,","C'est de toujours prier,","Face à la mort et à ses liens,","En paix il peut rester."]},{"label":"5.","lines":["Les saints qui prient ne forment qu'un,","Un cœur, une pensée.","Père et Fils leur sont en commun,","Une douce unité."]},{"label":"6.","lines":["Toi par qui nous venons à Dieu,","Tu es la Vérité.","Tu prias toujours, en tous lieux,","Apprends-nous à prier !"]}]}